  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation MAV+: Strengthening Vaccines and Pharmaceuticals Production in Ghana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific objective 1 (SO1)&lt;/strong&gt;: Strengthen Research and Development and facilitate technology transfer for sustainable pharmaceutical and vaccine manufacturing in Ghana&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific objective 2 (SO2)&lt;/strong&gt;: Establish processes for cGMP compliance for local manufacturing industry in partnership with regulators to ensure the production of quality and safe products and eligibility for WHO prequalification&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific objective 3 (SO3)&lt;/strong&gt;: Create an enabling environment for local production of vaccines and pharmaceuticals to ensure sustained availability of affordable and quality-assured medicines and vaccines in Ghana. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
